{"id":"en_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs","title":"Reborn to Right the Wrongs","titleEn":"Reborn to Right the Wrongs","description":"In her previous life, Jocelyn Wright gave everything to raise two sons, only for her husband and his mistress to claim she was never their real mother. Given a second chance when she is reborn on her sons' birthday, Jocelyn resolves to take revenge. She intends to bring their deception into the open and reshape the destiny that was once forced upon her. Those who want to follow how this story unfolds can find the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/reborn-to-right-the-wrongs/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/reborn-to-right-the-wrongs/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contemporary","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimia/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimia/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimia/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimia/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimia/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-to-right-the-wrongs_5","title":"Episode